# Vite build-time env. Copy to .env.local for local override.
#
# Where the React app should send `/api/*` calls.
# - Dev: leave empty so the Vite proxy (vite.config.ts) forwards /api → http://127.0.0.1:8000
# - Prod: default is same-origin `/api` (your host should proxy/rewrite `/api` → FastAPI).
#   If your API is hosted on a different origin, set this to the public API origin
#   including the /api prefix, e.g. https://your-api-service.onrender.com/api
#
# If this is unset, the frontend uses same-origin `/api`.
# VITE_API_BASE=https://your-api-service.onrender.com/api
